<title>USA: TABLE - Musicland Stores Corp Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Musicland Stores Corp Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.55     loss	 $0.72</p>
<p> Net	loss	   18,325     loss	24,080</p>
<p> Revs		     342,746		  372,410</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  33,507		   33,402</p>
<p>		     SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $1.17     loss	 $2.30</p>
<p> Net	loss	   39,308     loss	76,716</p>
<p> Revs		     718,826		  755,980</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  33,494		   33,387</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago amounts adjusted to reflect December 31, 1996, deferred tax valuation allowance in each quarter.</p>
<p>Six-month 1996 loss includes $35.0 million restructuring charge.</p>
<p>Q2 oper loss before depreciation and amortization $1.1 million vs loss $9.2 million.</p>
<p>Six-month 1997 oper loss before depreciation and amortization $4.6 million vs loss $18.9 million, which also excludes restructuring charge.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
